    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "买跌打损伤药\n\n丽丽：您好！我朋友跌倒了，您这里有没有治跌打损伤的药？\n药剂师：有的。这些都是。\n丽丽：哪个比较好？\n药剂师：我觉得这个不错。\n丽丽：好的，那就要这个吧。另外我还想要一些创可贴。\n药剂师：好的。\n丽丽：再帮我拿两盒止痛药和一盒晕车药。\n药剂师：好的。",
    "traditional": "買跌打損傷藥\n\n麗麗：您好！我朋友跌倒了，您這裡有沒有治跌打損傷的藥？\n藥劑師：有的。這些都是。\n麗麗：哪個比較好？\n藥劑師：我覺得這個不錯。\n麗麗：好的，那就要這個吧。另外我還想要一些創可貼。\n藥劑師：好的。\n麗麗：再幫我拿兩盒止痛藥和一盒暈車藥。\n藥劑師：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Buying Medicine for Injuries"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "丽丽：您好！我朋友跌倒了，您这里有没有治跌打损伤的药？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：您好！我朋友跌倒了，您這裡有沒有治跌打損傷的藥？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nín hǎo wǒ péng you diē dǎo le nín zhè lǐ yǒu méi yǒu zhì diē dǎ sǔn shāng de yào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Hello! My friend fell. Do you have medicine for injuries here?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "药剂师：有的。这些都是。",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：有的。這些都是。",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī yǒu de zhè xiē dōu shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pharmacist: Yes, all of these here."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "丽丽：哪个比较好？",
      "traditional": "麗麗：哪個比較好？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǎ ge bǐ jiào hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Which one is the best?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "药剂师：我觉得这个不错。",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：我覺得這個不錯。",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī wǒ jué de zhè ge bú cuò",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pharmacist: I think this one is pretty good."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "丽丽：好的，那就要这个吧。另外我还想要一些创可贴。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：好的，那就要這個吧。另外我還想要一些創可貼。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì hǎo de nà jiù yào zhè ge ba lìng wài wǒ hái xiǎng yào yì xiē chuāng kě tiē",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ok, I'll take that one. I also want some band-aids."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "药剂师：好的。",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：好的。",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pharmacist: Ok."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "丽丽：再帮我拿两盒止痛药和一盒晕车药。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：再幫我拿兩盒止痛藥和一盒暈車藥。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zài bāng wǒ ná liǎng hé zhǐ tòng yào hé yì hé yùn chē yào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Also, help me grab two boxes of painkillers and one box of motion sickness pills."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "药剂师：好的。",
      "traditional": "藥劑師：好的。",
      "pinyin": "yào jì shī hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Pharmacist: Ok."
    }
  ],
